    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, \"C ideologies on inland carriage\"? That sounds wrong. I thought CIF stood for Cost, Insurance, and Freight. Can you just give me a clear, professional breakdown of the seller's obligations regarding the freight and the insurance specifically? And please clarify exactly when the risk passes from the seller to us.",
